Package: apt-actions
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.7), apt (>= 1.8.2)
Maintainer: Gustavo Terra <179854972+gustavo-terra@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Run custom actions before and after apt package transactions.
 apt-actions provides a simple rule-based mechanism for executing commands when 
 packages are installed, upgraded, downgraded, reinstalled or removed.
